WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.320
Hi there, my name is Ian and I'm based in Bohol, Philippines.

00:00:04.320 --> 00:00:11.000
I work remotely and I'm comfortable with US, UK or Australian hours, including night shift.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:18.480
For the past six years, I've supported US companies in quality assurance, documentation and back-office operations.

00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:23.228
Right now, I'm at Nooro, where I build and test AI-assisted workflows.

00:00:23.228 --> 00:00:31.628
I restructured the knowledge base behind our AI call audits, which helped our customer experience team hold a 97% satisfaction score.

00:00:31.628 --> 00:00:36.348
Before that, I managed confidential records as a document specialist at TaskUs.

00:00:36.348 --> 00:00:42.000
And at Ibex, I led a team of 23 QA analysts across three countries.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:46.500
I have a strong technical foundation in Salesforce, G Suite and Monday.com.

00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:56.338
As a virtual assistant, I focus on the work that keeps a business running: task tracking and follow-ups, data entry, reports, SOPs and CRM updates.

00:00:56.338 --> 00:01:05.407
I also want to free up your time by managing your calendar, inbox and the everyday admin, so you can focus on the work only you can do.

00:01:05.567 --> 00:01:14.667
My goal is to grow into a long-term operations role with a team that values reliability, and to help the business run smoother every week.

00:01:14.667 --> 00:01:21.467
Again, my name is Ian. Thank you so much for the opportunity to introduce myself. I'd love to support your team.
